/android/app/release

# v101 — Firebase secrets defense-in-depth.
# `google-services.json` (in android/app/) IS expected to be tracked
# — it carries the project_id + a public Firebase API key, both safe
# to publish.
# Service-account JSONs (used server-side to send FCM messages) are
# private cryptographic credentials and must NEVER live inside this
# repo, even by accident. The pattern below catches Firebase's
# `*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json` naming convention.
**/*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
**/serviceAccountKey.json
**/firebase-service-account*.json
